    "summary": "Step 4b of both (identical) installer copies reads the chosen CLI family's tier defaults and the Ollama tool-loop model from the cloned definitions file with node; no tier-model or tool-loop literal remains. vscode-plugin/scripts/sync-manifest-catalog.mjs regenerates the manifest's catalog-backed settings from CONFIG_CATALOG (ollamaNumCtx removed; model defaults and the 'ultra' effort from the definitions; pre-existing drift in other catalog rows fixed) and the extension build runs it with --check. A JetBrains ModelTiersModelTest reads an unset tier from a catalog fixture built by buildConfigCatalog over non-shipped definitions, run by a Gradle-driving TS test, with a TS drift test. model-catalog-asset.test.ts's installer and summariser assertions are migrated. Known pre-existing failures (also on HEAD before s3): two vscode model-tier-picker provider-switch tests.",
    "testRecord": {
